<h1>Matebeto Help</h1>
<p class="tag">Let's eat. A product of 6images Advertising, Lusaka, Zambia.</p>

<h2>What is Matebeto?</h2>
<p>Matebeto is a food marketplace and delivery app for Lusaka. You choose the food, Matebeto finds a vendor to prepare it, and a rider delivers it to you.</p>

<h2>Where we deliver</h2>
<p>Thornpark, Longacres and Olympia. More areas will be added.</p>

<h2>Using the app</h2>
<p>One app has two modes: Customer and Rider. You can be a customer, a rider, or both. Your phone number does not lock you into one role.</p>

<h2>How to order</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Sign in with your mobile number and the one-time code we send you. You stay signed in until you log out.</li>
  <li>Choose your market and a food category, then a meal.</li>
  <li>Each meal shows a photo, name, description, price and its included sides.</li>
  <li>Choose your sides, set the quantity and add it to your basket.</li>
  <li>Choose bicycle or motorbike delivery. We only send the type you choose.</li>
  <li>At checkout you see Food Total, Platform Fee, Delivery Fee and Total. Then you pay.</li>
</ol>
<div class="box"><strong>Sides are free.</strong> They are part of the meal price. You never pay extra for them.</div>

<h2>One order, one vendor</h2>
<p>Your whole basket is prepared by one vendor, chosen by Matebeto. If we cannot find a suitable vendor, you can retry, change your basket or cancel.</p>

<h2>Order number and tracking</h2>
<p>Every order gets one permanent number, like #1042. It stays the same from start to finish. You can follow your order from "Order received" to "Delivered".</p>

<h2>Your delivery code</h2>
<div class="box">Give your delivery code to the rider <strong>only when your food arrives</strong>. The order is complete only when the code is entered correctly. A wrong code does not complete the delivery, and our support team can help if it cannot be resolved.</div>

<h2>If you are not available</h2>
<p>The rider will call or message you, wait about 10 minutes, try again, and then contact support. Without a correct delivery code the order is not completed.</p>

<h2>If something goes wrong</h2>
<ul>
  <li>If a vendor cannot fulfil your order, we look for another vendor for your full basket. Your order number stays the same.</li>
  <li>If a rider cannot continue, we assign another rider. Your order number stays the same.</li>
  <li>If no rider is free, you can wait, retry or change your delivery type.</li>
  <li>If we cannot fulfil your order, it is cancelled and refunded according to our refund rules below.</li>
</ul>

<h2>For riders</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Apply in the app with your name, mobile number, address, vehicle (bicycle or motorbike) and ID details.</li>
  <li>Your status can be Pending, Approved, Rejected or Suspended. Only approved riders receive jobs.</li>
  <li>Go online to receive delivery jobs. You can accept or decline each one.</li>
  <li>At pickup, check that the order number matches the vendor's, then confirm pickup.</li>
  <li>At delivery, ask the customer for their delivery code and enter it in the app.</li>
  <li>Earnings follow a successfully verified delivery.</li>
</ul>

